  "steps": [
    "Cook the onions low and slow until soft, then keep going until deeply browned.",
    "In the last 10 minutes, add the balsamic, then the red wine, and cook until jammy.",
    "Meanwhile, confit the garlic with the thyme in olive oil until soft and golden.",
    "Blend most of the onions with the garlic confit and beef broth until completely smooth, keeping a few spoonfuls of onions aside.",
    "Bring the sauce to a gentle simmer in a pan, add the cooked spaghetti and toss.",
    "Fold in the reserved onions, turn off the heat and toss in the Parmigiano until glossy."
